# Sources: level range = foreverchanges.pro/dungeons (Classic group-finder range, not confirmed for Forever);
# quests = ForeverChanges quest list (research/digest) and Questie; entrance = Questie.
@dungeon Zul'Farrak
@levels 44-54
@window 43-50
@best 46
@hub Tanaris, 51.6, 27.0, 5
@entrance Tanaris, 38.7, 20.1
A 2864 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 26.9, 77.2 | Krazek in Booty Bay. It sends you to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.
>T 2864 @ Tanaris, 51.6, 26.8
>A 2865 @ Tanaris, 51.6, 26.8 | 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells from the scarabs inside.
A 2846 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 46.1, 57.1 | Tabetha, in her hut in the marsh. The Tiara of the Deep drops from Hydromancer Velratha.
A 2770 @ Thousand Needles, 78.1, 77.1 | Wizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway. Gahz'rilla is summoned with the Mallet of Zul'Farrak, which takes its own trip to the Hinterlands; skip this one if your group does not have the mallet.
A 3527 @ Tanaris, 67.0, 22.4 | Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port, after Screecher Spirits. The two tablets drop from Theka the Martyr and Hydromancer Velratha.
A 3042 @ Tanaris, 51.4, 28.8 | Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan. 20 Vials of Troll Temper from the trolls inside.
A 2768 @ Tanaris, 52.5, 28.5 | Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan. The rod drops from Sergeant Bly after the stairs fight.
RUN | The entrance is in the north-west corner of Tanaris, a short ride from Gadgetzan.
